anding  and exceptional contribution to film  television or games previous recipients  have included Shigeru Miyamoto will  write Peter Molyneux and gabe newell so  what do you think about this year's  winners what are your predictions for  the next year in games let us know in  the comments section below or find me on  Twitter at a regular Dave and for all  your award-winning news stay tuned to  gamespot com  you
 

